    "tree_id": "ca5067af6a84d2b75c1ded43a3dd7c569d643a53",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:761] build the private test IPA 761: RPCS3 Core 941 (heat lot of the IPA 760 logs) and the MeloNX Core after IPA 759, on base 760\n\nRPCS3 Core 941 request 2 (pin b54b6fee, run 43929679850, fingerprint 9ea6fcf6) replaces Core 940:\nREWINDBOX_LIGHT_LOAD_941 (while a game is light, its PPU, SPU and RSX threads run in the utility class and take\ntheir own classes back within one 500 ms sample) and REWINDBOX_RSX_IDLE_941 (the idle park slice follows the idle\ntime; the grace period waits on the PUT line in every thermal state once the wait is known to rest the core).\nCodegen identities unchanged. The MeloNX Core of the lot after IPA 759 is taken by its session's verified pin\n(a320d7ab, run 43933768917, packagedFingerprint 3df6c45b; recipe 3.12). The S2Arm engine keeps the base's pin:\npatch 0051 (53fdc143) stays source only for 762, as its session confirmed. Contract (offline), freeze and trigger\npaths checked. Flutter and native test groups not run (AGENTS.md). Not run on an iPhone; no heat, energy or frame\nrate claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-16T19:14:45Z",
